            "body": "**<sub><sub>![P2 Badge](https://img.shields.io/badge/P2-yellow?style=flat)</sub></sub>  Block Sky handoff while the coordinate flight is pending**\n\nWhen a user submits coordinates and clicks \u201cEnter Sky here\u201d before the approximately 0.9-second `navigateLocation` flight completes, this button remains enabled and starts `getNavigationState` concurrently. The snapshot therefore captures an intermediate camera center, and teardown cancels the remaining flight, opening Sky at the wrong location. Disable the handoff button while `pending`, or await the location flight before allowing the transition.\n\nUseful? React with \ud83d\udc4d\u00a0/ \ud83d\udc4e.\n\n<!-- codex-code-review-finding:v1 -->",
